{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And YHWH said: I will blot out the human.</b> He is dust, and I will bring water upon him and blot him out — therefore the language of blotting is used." "<b>From human to beast.</b> They too corrupted their ways (Bereshit Rabbah). Another matter: all was created for the sake of the human, and since he is being destroyed, what need is there for these?" "<b>For I regret that I made them.</b> I deliberated what to do about that which I made."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:41.309500657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}